## 四、注入语法

chunk 体内的代码交给宿主语言的语法去着色，于是 `<<print_result>>` 这种引用行会被 C 语法当成两个小于号加标识符。注入语法把它抢回来：只在 `meta.embedded.block` 范围里生效，只认整行引用。

选择器写 `L:` 前缀，意思是"在这个作用域及其子作用域里注入"。

tangle/editor/syntaxes/nw-injection.tmLanguage.json @

<< injection grammar >>= @
	{
	  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/martinring/tmlanguage/master/tmlanguage.json",
	  "name": "Neoweb Injection",
	  "scopeName": "nw.injection",
	  "injectionSelector": "L:meta.embedded.block",
	  "patterns": [
	    {
	      "comment": "嵌套的块头：<< 路径: 名字 >>= @",
	      "match": "^([ \\t]*)(<<)(?:([^<>\\n:]*?)(?<!:)(:)(?!:))?([^<>\\n]*?)(>>)(=)([ \\t]*)(@)([ \\t]*)$",
	      "captures": {
	        "2": { "name": "punctuation.definition.chunk.begin.nw" },
	        "3": { "name": "string.unquoted.path.nw" },
	        "4": { "name": "punctuation.separator.key-value.nw" },
	        "5": { "name": "entity.name.function.chunk.nw" },
	        "6": { "name": "punctuation.definition.chunk.end.nw" },
	        "7": { "name": "keyword.operator.assignment.nw" },
	        "9": { "name": "keyword.control.head-marker.nw" }
	      }
	    },
	    {
	      "comment": "嵌套块的收尾：~@",
	      "match": "^([ \\t]*)(~@)([ \\t]*)$",
	      "captures": { "2": { "name": "keyword.control.chunk.terminator.nw" } }
	    },
	    {
	      "comment": "整行的 chunk 引用，要从宿主语言里抢一行",
	      "match": "^([ \\t]*)(<<)([^<>\\n]+?)(>>)([ \\t]*)$",
	      "captures": {
	        "2": { "name": "punctuation.definition.chunk.begin.nw" },
	        "3": { "name": "entity.name.function.chunk.nw" },
